KeyPoint: let us say we have object instance 'obj1' and if we copies and passes the same references of this obj1 to any methods
, whatever changes in that method is done, will applies the same to the original object instance 'obj1' too.

and this way even though, you are passing the copy of the object , you are passing the ORIGINAL OBJECT REFERENCE also.
